-- A type the file declares keeps its own schema even when its name is also a
-- spelling of a builtin. `Text` here is a record, so the input must be an
-- object with a `body`, not a JSON string.

DECLARE Text HAS `body` IS A NUMBER

@export default the body of a text
GIVEN t IS A Text
GIVETH A NUMBER
`body of` t MEANS t's `body`

#EVAL `body of` (Text OF 3)
